# Two meters above were invisible before this week. `Standard Private
# Endpoint` is priced under region 'Global' and `Private Zone` on a bare
# unit of "1" -- the gate filtered by region and only treated "1/Hour"
# and "1/Month" as recurring, so it had never seen either.
